    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d373">

                <pb facs="0545" n="471" xml:id="pg471"/>

                <head>Mr. Prevost to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 15.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            10, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit to your
                    excellency copy and translation of an official note from Mr. Bustamente, the
                    minister for foreign affairs, acknowledging receipt of my note of May 20, which
                    contained a copy of the note addressed by your excellency to the chargé
                    d’affaires of Chili at Washington.</p>
                <p>As soon as I shall receive a further communication from Quito, I will at once
                    transmit it to your excellency as instructed,</p>
                <p>I remain, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>L. V. PREVOST, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of
                            Legation.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d373-a1.xml" xpointer="d373-a1"/>
            </div>
